<title>USA: Travelers in venture with Tishman Speyer.</title>
<headline>Travelers in venture with Tishman Speyer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Travelers Insurance Co and Tishman Speyer Properties LP said on Thursday they formed a joint venture capitalized at $600 million to focus on domestic commercial properties.</p>
<p>Two companies will jointly serve as asset managers, but Tishman will handle day-to-day property management and leasing activities.</p>
<p>The venture already has acquired 10 properties from a Travelers affliate. Travelers is a unit of Travelers Group Inc.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
